==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Stall for a while so you can build up cash for your stronger units, such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]]. Provided you have all [[Treasure]]s from the chapter, this stage should not prove to be too difficult.

Be aware of the reviving [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]]. As long as you're constantly pushing out new meatshields and damage dealers, you should be fine.

